diff --git a/changes/ticket41339_prev_hop_metrics b/changes/ticket41339_prev_hop_metrics
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..599c9b7af5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changes/ticket41339_prev_hop_metrics
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+  o Minor features (metrics port, relay):
+    - Count CREATE cells, BEGIN_DIR cells, and the circuits that send
+      BEGIN_DIR cells by kind of previous hop (an unauthenticated client or
+      bridge, a relay we know, or a relay identity we don't know), and label
+      tor_relay_dir_requests_total by the same kind. Onion service requests
+      on a circuit that is already closing are now counted as action
+      "closing" rather than "single_hop". This tells an operator whether a
+      flood of BEGIN_DIR streams comes over one-hop circuits from clients or
+      over circuits extended by relays. Part of ticket 41339.
